sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant UI as auth UI
  participant R as auth repository (NOT_RECOVERED)
  participant T as ri.* token holder
  participant API as api.mimo.org
  U->>UI: credentials
  UI->>R: login request (payload NOT_RECOVERED)
  R->>API: POST (endpoint among 9 unauthenticated)
  API-->>R: token
  R->>T: store token
  Note over T: fh.a reads token for every later call
